# Drums: 10

> Demo assigning velocity to individual sub-tokens inside a Group.
> \".\" means explicit default (Empty). In [. . . 80], only the 4th gets vel=80.

hh | ^  ^  ^           ^   |
sn | .   ^   [^ . . ^]     |
v  |         [. . . 80]    |
bd | ^  .  ^           .   |

# Piano: 1

> A scalar value is broadcast to the entire Group.

C3 | ^   ^ [^ ^ ^ ^]  |
v  | 100   60         |
